menuconfig MY_SENSOR
    bool "Capteur de temperature bosh bme 280"

    default y
    depends on SENSOR && I2C
    depends on DT_HAS_BOCSH_BME280_ENABLED
    select SENSOR_ASYNC_API

    help
      Active le driver I2C du BME280 utilisant Read and Decode
      pour la temperature, la pression et lhumidite.
